{ INSTALL SCRIPT FOR 'MICRO MACHINES' PC }

{ VERSION : 9/9/94 }

PRINT ""
PRINT "THIS PROGRAM WILL INSTALL A DOS VERSION OF 'MICRO MACHINES' TO HARD DISK"
PRINT ""
PRINT ""
PRINT "IF YOU WANT TO INSTALL THE WINDOWS VERSION THEN PLEASE DO THE FOLLOWING :"
PRINT ""
PRINT "         - PRESS 'N' TO THE FOLLOWING PROMPT"
PRINT "         - RUN WINDOWS AS NORMAL"
PRINT "         - CHOOSE 'RUN' FROM THE 'FILE' MENU OF PROGRAM MANAGER"
PRINT "         - TYPE 'A:\SETUP.EXE'"
PRINT ""
PRINT ""
PRINT "YOU WILL NEED APROXIMATELY 700,000 BYTES FREE HARD DISK SPACE."
PRINT ""
PRINT "DO YOU WISH TO CONTINUE WITH THIS INSTALL ?"
PRINT ""
PRINT "PRESS Y TO CONTINUE OR N TO ABORT."
PRINT ""

CONFIRM DONTINSTALL


PRINT ""
PRINT "PLEASE ENTER THE PATH ON THE HARD DISK TO INSTALL TO (IE C:\MICROM)"
PRINT ""

